      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero grid-overlay">
    <div class="container hero-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Contractor business ke liye built</div>
        <h1>Projects, Workers<br>aur Site Finance ka<br><span class="accent">One System</span></h1>
        <p>
          Contractor management software tabhi useful hota hai jab aapko site par real control de.
          Thekedaari ke through aap project wise attendance, labour cost, site expense, advance, payment,
          outstanding aur profitability ko structured format me manage kar sakte ho.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Get Free Setup</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://thekedaari.com/thekedaar-software">Explore Features</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust"><span>Smart for small contractors. Powerful for growing teams.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="float-card fc-1"><div class="float-icon">🏗️</div><div><strong>3 Active Sites</strong><span>Project wise monitoring</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-2"><div class="float-icon">👷</div><div><strong>42 Workers</strong><span>Live attendance status</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-3"><div class="float-icon">🧾</div><div><strong>14 Expenses</strong><span>Daily entries synced</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-4"><div class="float-icon">📉</div><div><strong>Margin Alert</strong><span>Cost leakage detected</span></div></div>
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="screen">
            <div class="app-top"><span>Thekedaari</span><span>Projects</span></div>
            <div class="profile-card">
              <div class="profile-header">Contractor Overview</div>
              <div class="profile-body">
                <div>Site A • Running</div>
                <div>Pending payout: ₹18,500</div>
                <a class="install-btn" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Start managing</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dashboard-grid">
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Active Sites</small><strong>3</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Today Expense</small><strong>₹8,200</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Pending Wages</small><strong>₹18K</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Expected Margin</small><strong>18%</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Contractor management ke liye core modules</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Ye page contractor keyword ko target karta hai, isliye content project control, operations aur business monitoring par focused hai.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📁</div><h3>Project Wise Management</h3><p>Har site ya project ke liye alag records. Expense, labour aur payment ko mix hone se bachao.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">💵</div><h3>Cash Flow & Payment Tracking</h3><p>Kitna paisa aaya, kitna gaya, kitna balance hai aur kis site ka status weak hai — sab clear.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📊</div><h3>Decision Reports</h3><p>Manual guessing ki jagah data-based reporting. Contractor ko margin aur due visibility milti hai.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="operations">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Daily contractor operations ko simple banao</h3>
        <p>
          Contractor business me delay aur confusion tab hota hai jab attendance, petty cash, supplier expense aur labour payment ek system me na ho.
          Thekedaari aapko project-based control deta hai jisse aap har site ke real numbers dekh sakte ho aur faster billing ya planning kar sakte ho.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Site wise cost monitoring</li>
          <li>Labour attendance + wages</li>
          <li>Advance payment ledger</li>
          <li>Material & vendor expenses</li>
          <li>Outstanding overview</li>
          <li>Profitability tracking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Useful for every contractor category</h3>
        <p>
          Civil contractor, finishing contractor, interior contractor, plumbing contractor, fabrication contractor ya local builder team — sab apne process ke according use kar sakte hain.
          Interface simple hai, isliye staff ko jaldi samajh aata hai.
        </p>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Multi Site</strong><span>Project tracking</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Live</strong><span>Expense updates</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Clean</strong><span>Worker records</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Fast</strong><span>Daily decisions</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Simple onboarding for contractor teams</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">No heavy setup. Direct practical use from day one.</p>
      <div class="panel" style="text-align:left; margin-top:22px;">
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h4>Create your contractor account</h4><p>Company ya contractor profile setup karo.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h4>Add projects, workers and expense heads</h4><p>Real structure set ho jayega jisse records better maintain honge.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h4>Track business daily</h4><p>Dashboard par attendance, kharcha, balance aur profitability dekhte raho.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <div>
            <h2>Contractor management software chahiye jo practical ho?</h2>
            <p>Thekedaari use karo aur apne projects, workers aur site finance ko structured tareeke se handle karo.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Start Free</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://thekedaari.com/mazdoor-attendance-app">Attendance Page</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-wrap">
      <div>© 2026 Thekedaari. Contractor management software built for Indian site teams.</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
